1
00:00:00,547 --> 00:00:03,637
(Leonard:)You are not in this relationship.

2
00:00:05,051 --> 00:00:06,721
(Leonard:)I am.

3
00:00:06,886 --> 00:00:10,226
(Leonard:)Ergo, you have no say...

4
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:14,180
(Leonard:)...in anything that happens
between me and Stephanie.

5
00:00:15,645 --> 00:00:17,065
(Sheldon:)I'm afraid I can't allow that.

6
00:00:18,606 --> 00:00:21,026
(Sheldon:)Pursuant to Starfleet General Order 104,
Section A...

7
00:00:21,192 --> 00:00:24,862
(Sheldon:)...you are deemed unfit,
and I hereby relieve you of your command.

8
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,780
(Sheldon:)General Order 104, Section A
does not apply in this situation.

9
00:00:30,952 --> 00:00:35,082
- Give me one good reason why not.
- Because this is not Star Trek.

10
00:00:40,712 --> 00:00:41,842
(Sheldon:)Penny.

11
00:00:42,005 --> 00:00:43,215
(Sheldon:)Penny.

12
00:00:43,381 --> 00:00:44,961
(Sheldon:)Penny.

13
00:00:45,341 --> 00:00:46,551
(Penny:)What?

14
00:00:46,718 --> 00:00:49,008
(Sheldon:)This is banana bread.

15
00:00:50,722 --> 00:00:52,932
(Penny:)This is a door knob.

16
00:00:54,642 --> 00:00:57,392
(Sheldon:)It's my understanding
that an unsolicited gift of food...

17
00:00:57,562 --> 00:01:04,022
(Sheldon:)...can be a precursor to an impromptu
invitation to come in and chat.

